> world info crates/content/tests/fixtures/maps/hand-made.map
hand-made.map: 70 × 66 tiles in 2 × 2 chunks, 3 overrides, 6 suggestions (1 dismissed; 1 dismissal not on the map); 11995 bytes
recipe: hand-made, source pixels (3, 4) to (37, 36), 2 tiles a source pixel, seed 7; detail 0.25 of the relief, 8.00 pixels, 4 octaves; shallows to 10.00 metres, specks under 4 tiles; levels every 5.00 of Azgaar's heights, specks under 4 tiles; foliage at scale 1.00, trees 2.00, shrubs 1.50 and grass 1.00 tiles apart
> world suggestions crates/content/tests/fixtures/maps/hand-made.map
