settlement_9 Riverhold: river, capital, port, 24129 people, at tile (12, 40); citadel, plaza and shanty town
route_4_2 Ferry way: sea route, 3 points, tile (0, 0) to (12, 40)
poi_0: ruins, at tile (33, 7); Walls of an older keep. (dismissed)
culture_2 Riverfolk: river; 40 cells and 61234 people in the source, 1200 tiles on the map
religion_5 Ferry Saints: heresy, Sect, of culture_2; 12 cells and 9001 people in the source, 300 tiles on the map
state_3 Riverhold: Free City of Riverhold, union, of culture_7 (not on the map), capital settlement_9; vassal toward state_1 (not on the map), suzerain toward state_4 (not on the map); 40 cells and 61234 people in the source, 4620 tiles on the map
dismissed, not on the map: route_7
> assert world info content/sample/factions.toml == error: this isn't a Factional map
> assert world info == error: world needs the form: world info <file>, world source <file>, world suggestions <map>, world dismiss <map> <id> [<id>…], world restore <map> <id> [<id>…], or world import <export> <map> [--region <x>,<y>,<width>,<height>] [--scale <n>] [--seed <n>] [--detail <strength>] [--wavelength <pixels>] [--octaves <n>] [--shallows <metres>] [--specks <tiles>] [--levels <points>] [--level-specks <tiles>] [--foliage <scale>] [--tree-spacing <tiles>] [--shrub-spacing <tiles>] [--grass-spacing <tiles>]
